    },
    "A library that keeps refusing is usually a full device or an iCloud account that is out of room. Free some space, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تكرار الفشل غالبًا سببه امتلاء الجهاز أو نفاد مساحة iCloud. أفرغ شيئًا من المساحة ثم أعد المحاولة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder is one line on the lock screen with the shot attached. It is scheduled on this phone — nothing is registered anywhere.": {
